{
  "about": "What kyrr and its Omarchy bar menu (github.com/heast13/omarchy-kyrr) share: the lines kyrr's socket takes, how each control of the window is done in the menu, and a full sample of the state file. scripts/check-omarchy-contract.py keeps it true against kyrr's code; the menu's CI checks itself against it. See docs/release-gate.md. Side files beside the state, in $XDG_RUNTIME_DIR/kyrr: sheet and edit (the open recording's text and what the menu typed into it), compare (the text before and after the language model, JSON in rich text, while the menu compares), prompt and promptedit (the instruction of the task the menu shows and the wording the menu wants). Each starts with a line naming its recording or task.",
  "commands": {
    "background": "a start while kyrr runs: nothing; the menu's 'is kyrr there' probe",
    "dictate": "dictation key: start or stop",
